  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping agroecology Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a mapping by RVO&apos;s team Sustainable Territorial Development (GRO), by doing desk research, interviews and a workshop.The mapping&#x2022;	will eventually contribute to the development of agroecology in Les Niayes in Senegal.&#x2022;	will help too	understand which stakeholders play a role and should be involved in the promotion of agroecology within the HortiC&#xf4;te combitrack in Senegal;o	understand the challenges that hamper implementation and scaling of agro ecological practices;o	identify horticultural projects with an agroecological approach that are under way and for which Dutch knowledge and expertise could be of benefit;o	make a first overview of themes the stakeholders are addressing, and/or see missing;o	identify climate resilient opportunities to address under the HortiC&#xf4;te combi-track agroecology pillar, possibly with the engagement of Dutch organisations and companies.</narrative>
  </description>
